  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Infrastructura y Desarrollo Parroquial</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parish Infrastructure Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM SEEKS TO STRENGTHEN THE ABILITY OF LOCAL GOVERNMENT TO PERFORM THEIR LEGALLY MANDATED TASKS, FOCUSING ON: PROMOTING THE DEVELOPMENT OF OWN-SOURCE REVENUES, IMPROVING FINANCIAL MANAGEMENT, AND INCORPORATING COMMUNITY PARTICIPATION IN LOCAL DECISION-MAKING. THE PROGRAM FINANCES INFRASTRUCTURE REHABILITATION IN THE PARISHES, PRIMARILY IN ROADS, WATER AND SEWERAGE, MARKETS AND MUNICIPAL FACILITIES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
